description: |
  Reverts one or more previous override actions that added or removed assets from an AppSec application (by application id or name). All assets from the same override batch are reverted at once. Each provided action ID is processed independently (best-effort): a failure on one action ID does not abort the others, and per-action results are returned. After reverting, the system re-runs its relationship algorithm asynchronously to update the application's asset topology.
